00:36:35,407 --> 00:36:37,627
<i>A clue emerged.</i>

736
00:36:39,577 --> 00:36:41,277
My fork...

737
00:37:06,537 --> 00:37:08,957
Cell phone
 Microwave oven

738
00:37:10,277 --> 00:37:12,807
<i>Don't forget, and you'll find a way.</i>

739
00:37:20,777 --> 00:37:22,097
<i>Hello?</i>

740
00:37:22,097 --> 00:37:24,207
Can I ask you something real quick?

741
00:37:24,207 --> 00:37:28,007
<i>I'm currently in my Super After-Glow State. Ask away!</i>

742
00:37:28,007 --> 00:37:29,397
I didn't need to know that!

743
00:37:30,747 --> 00:37:33,207
You know about SERN, right?

744
00:37:33,207 --> 00:37:37,467
<i>Gulp... Why? Were you spying on my computer?</i>

745
00:37:38,317 --> 00:37:39,797
What do you mean?

746
00:37:39,797 --> 00:37:42,867
<i>How do you know about my solo hacking job?</i>

747
00:37:43,187 --> 00:37:46,477
Hacking?! Hacking SERN?! Why?

748
00:37:46,477 --> 00:37:49,927
<i>Why?! Because... Huh, I'm not sure.</i>

749
00:37:51,837 --> 00:37:54,577
Stay at the lab. I'll be right there.

750
00:38:05,427 --> 00:38:06,897
Cell phone...

751
00:38:09,337 --> 00:38:10,187
SERN!

752
00:38:25,337 --> 00:38:27,527
That ribbon is so cute!

753
00:38:27,527 --> 00:38:29,377
Isn't it?

754
00:38:29,377 --> 00:38:34,287
Wanna try it on? I have other costumes for the next ComiMa.

755
00:38:34,287 --> 00:38:35,527
Cosplay?

756
00:38:35,527 --> 00:38:37,757
Interested?

757
00:38:37,757 --> 00:38:41,887
Of course not! I could never wear something like that in public.

758
00:38:42,927 --> 00:38:44,097
Finished!

759
00:38:45,787 --> 00:38:47,427
Mayushii wins!

760
00:38:47,427 --> 00:38:51,617
You beat us! But we're done too.

761
00:38:51,617 --> 00:38:53,727
It's complete. This is...

762
00:38:56,237 --> 00:38:59,517
This is the time-leap machine! Intense...

763
00:38:59,517 --> 00:39:01,067
I'm not fully convinced myself.

764
00:39:01,547 --> 00:39:06,157
But by using the LHC hacked from SERN, we can compress brain signals

765
00:39:06,157 --> 00:39:08,957
and send them from here to the past with this Phone Microwave.

766
00:39:09,507 --> 00:39:12,457
At least theoretically, it is feasible.

767
00:39:12,457 --> 00:39:15,007
Well thought!

768
00:39:15,007 --> 00:39:19,167
More like "remembered."

769
00:39:20,067 --> 00:39:23,477
Have you made this before, Miss Makise?

770
00:39:23,477 --> 00:39:25,807
No... I have no memory of it.

